	<div class="row">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">What is it?</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
	  <p class="mb-0">A transformational workshop is designed not to simply allow you to iteratively improve on a skill, but to fundamentally change the nature of your reality. The goal is to help you in taking a larger step in the changes you want to be making in your life.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>

	  <p class="mb-0"> During the retreat we will be focused on setting aside your current reality, leaving all devices and contact with the outside world behind. In this unfettered space we will work in a spirit of radical openness to deeply explore your inner nature. This will allow you the freedom to question any base assumptions you have and to try on the roles in life that you have otherwise been relegating to fantasy. This is a chance to simply be someone new, with new assumptions about yourself and new dynamics within a group, that you may never have been able to live out before. This is not simply a role-play experience, rather it is a chance to live this new role in a space where you are fully accepted for being who you want to be.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>

<p class="mb-0"> The Yomonsni Transformational Retreat Workshops invite you to leave all your inhibitions locked away with your devices.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>


            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div inner-row>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>




	<div class="row">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">What's included</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">With no fixed schedule, the following elements will be present:</p>
	    <ul>
	    <li>Facilitator led sessions helping you to discover and express attributes about who you want to be and what is important to you. Attributes of this will be captured into your personal coda, helping you to remember and act correctly on this transformed self. </li>

	    <li>You will be asked to serve the Sanctuary space hosting the retreat, helping to cook and clean during your stay. This cooperative work supports your new roles in a wider range of interaction patterns and helps ensure that the Sanctuary is always in a better place after you leave.</li>

	    <li>Guided meditation sessions, helping you to deepen the acceptance of these newly expressed parts of you.</li>

	    <li>Focused movement work and other somatic exercises designed and intended to bring you into the moment and into your body to allow you to integrate your newly expressed self into your body. These will include indoor and outdoor yoga/pilates sessions, combining elements of acro/partnered yoga into more traditional mat work, empowering walks in nature, allowing you a chance to feel the breeze, sun, or rain upon all of your skin, and an exploration of holotropic and other breathwork. </li>

	    <li>Space will be held for each participant to experience the full depth of Yomonsni Massage experience. </li>
	    </ul>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div inner-row>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>



