	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">These workshop retreats are a women only, device free experience. Designed as a safe space with no distractions.</p>
	    <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>

	    <p class="mb-0">We have a very limited number of spaces available, so please get in touch before they fill up.</p>
	    <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>

	    <p class="mb-0">Yomonsni, and the Yomonsni Transformational Retreat Workshop series operate on a pay as you believe and can basis. We strive to make our services available no matter what your financial situation. What is this experience worth to you, and what can you afford to pay for it?</p>
	    <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>


            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
